1|0.6491228199873578
-STATEMENT CALL threads=4
---- ok
-STATEMENT CALL page_rank(['N'], ['E']) YIELD node, score RETURN node.id, score ORDER BY node.id
-CHECK_PRECISION
-CHECK_ORDER
---- 2
0|0.35087718001264234
1|0.6491228199873578
-STATEMENT CALL page_rank(['N'], ['E']) RETURN node.id, score ORDER BY node.id
-CHECK_PRECISION
-CHECK_ORDER
---- 2
0|0.35087718001264234
1|0.6491228199873578
-STATEMENT CALL page_rank(['N'], ['E']) YIELD score AS rank, node AS ranked RETURN ranked.id, rank ORDER BY ranked.id
-CHECK_PRECISION
-CHECK_ORDER
---- 2
0|0.35087718001264234
1|0.6491228199873578
