---- 1
1|0.649123
-STATEMENT UNWIND [10,20] AS outer CALL page_rank(['N'], ['E']) YIELD node, score RETURN outer, node.id, score ORDER BY outer, node.id
-CHECK_PRECISION
-CHECK_ORDER
